This directory carries binary inputs that must be included in the Debian
source package.  It intentionally contains no OFD implementation source.

On a trusted host that has access to the private OFD source, build the OXT and
run:

    debian/scripts/import-ofd-oxt /path/to/loongoffice-ofd-extension.oxt

Commit the resulting loongoffice-ofd-extension.oxt and its .sha256 file.
debian/source/include-binaries makes the binary OXT part of the 3.0 (quilt)
source package; the text checksum is included with the other debian/ files.
The normal package build verifies the digest and rejects OXT archives that
contain common implementation-source file types.
